{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b3f2f1a0-6e2a-4d3a-9b1e-prueba-tecnica-items",
    "name": "Prueba Tecnica - Backend/Cloud (items)",
    "description": "Coleccion para probar la API local (serverless-offline) del scaffold: health check y el recurso de ejemplo items (crear, obtener por id, listar paginado). Ver client/index.html y docs/BUENAS_PRACTICAS.md en el repo para el contexto completo.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Generar con: npm run dev:token -- dev-user-1" },
    { "key": "itemId", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Se completa automaticamente al correr 'Crear item'" },
    { "key": "nextToken", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Se completa automaticamente al correr 'Listar items' si hay mas paginas" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "No requiere autenticacion. Confirma que serverless-offline esta corriendo."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Items",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear item",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status code es 201', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('itemId', body.id);",
                  "    pm.test('la respuesta trae id, ownerId y createdAt', function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(body).to.have.property('id');",
                  "        pm.expect(body).to.have.property('ownerId');",
                  "        pm.expect(body).to.have.property('createdAt');",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Laptop de prueba\",\n  \"description\": \"item creado desde Postman\",\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"{{$guid}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["items"]
            },
            "description": "Crea un item. idempotencyKey se genera automaticamente ({{$guid}}) en cada request; reenviar la MISMA idempotencyKey dos veces devuelve el mismo item en vez de duplicarlo (ver src/lib/items-repository.ts). Guarda el id devuelto en la variable de coleccion 'itemId' para usarlo en 'Obtener item por id'."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear item (reintento idempotente)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Laptop de prueba (reintento)\",\n  \"description\": \"mismo idempotencyKey que el item ya creado\",\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"{{itemId}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["items"]
            },
            "description": "Reusa 'itemId' (guardado por 'Crear item') como idempotencyKey a proposito: debe devolver el MISMO item original (mismo name/description que la primera vez), no uno nuevo ni un error. Correr 'Crear item' primero."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener item por id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status code es 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items/{{itemId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["items", "{{itemId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Usa la variable 'itemId' (se completa automaticamente al correr 'Crear item')."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener item inexistente (404)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status code es 404', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items/no-existe-este-id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["items", "no-existe-este-id"]
            },
            "description": "Caso de error: id que no existe. Debe responder 404 NOT_FOUND (ver src/lib/errors.ts)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar items",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status code es 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.nextToken) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('nextToken', body.nextToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items?limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["items"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista los items del owner autenticado (por JWT), mas recientes primero. Usa Query sobre el GSI1, nunca Scan (ver src/lib/items-repository.ts)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar items (siguiente pagina)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items?limit=20&nextToken={{nextToken}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["items"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "nextToken", "value": "{{nextToken}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Pagina siguiente usando 'nextToken' (se completa automaticamente al correr 'Listar items' si el resultado trae mas paginas)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar items (limit invalido, 400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status code es 400', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items?limit=9999",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["items"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "9999" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Caso de error: limit fuera de rango (maximo 100, ver ListItemsQuerySchema en src/types/item.ts). Debe responder 400 VALIDATION_ERROR."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear item sin token (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status code es 401', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Sin token\",\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"{{$guid}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/items",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["items"]
            },
            "description": "Caso de error: sin header Authorization. Debe responder 401 UNAUTHORIZED (ver src/middleware/auth.ts)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
